\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.9}{\ignorespaces Spreadsheet output of Two Firm / One Person example. If $\rho > 0.75$ the symmetric equilibrium is not stable: a slight difference in price leads to feedback to one, higher efficiency Firm and one lower. Note: $60$ iterations are shown in (a) as convergence happens quickly. \relax }}{207}}
